iving continuously.","english":"Arrive one after another.","characters":[{"char":"纷","gloss":"众多","icon":"🔢"},{"char":"至","gloss":"到来","icon":"⭐"},{"char":"沓","gloss":"接连","icon":"⭐"},{"char":"来","gloss":"来到","icon":"⭐"}],"exampleParts":{"before":"活动开始后，","idiom":"纷至沓来","collocation":"的报名者","after":"让现场越来越热闹。"},"comic":{"sprite":"assets/chengyu/v2/idioms-41-50.webp","index":7,"sliceWidth":420,"sliceHeight":344}},{"num":49,"id":"奉公守法","pinyin":"fèng gōng shǒu fǎ","explain":"奉行公务，遵守法令。","usage":"Use it for law-abiding conduct, especially in public duties or civic behavior.","english":"Act dutifully and obey the law.","characters":[{"char":"奉","gloss":"奉行","icon":"⭐"},{"char":"公","gloss":"公务","icon":"🛡️"},{"char":"守","gloss":"遵守","icon":"⭐"},{"char":"法","gloss":"法令","icon":"🛡️"}],"exampleParts":{"before":"每个人都应","idiom":"奉公守法","collocation":"地办事","after":"，共同维护秩序。"},"comic":{"sprite":"assets/chengyu/v2/idioms-41-50.webp","index":8,"sliceWidth":420,"sliceHeight":344}},{"num":50,"id":"敷衍塞责","pinyin":"fū yǎn sè zé","explain":"做事马虎，只求应付交差。","usage":"Use it for careless work done only to meet responsibility on the surface.","english":"Do a job carelessly just to get by.","characters":[{"char":"敷","gloss":"应付","icon":"⭐"},{"char":"衍","gloss":"草率","icon":"⭐"},{"char":"塞","gloss":"搪塞","icon":"⭐"},{"char":"责","gloss":"责任","icon":"🛡️"}],"exampleParts":{"before":"值日时不能","idiom":"敷衍塞责","collocation":"地打扫","after":"，要真正把教室整理好。"},"comic":{"sprite":"assets/chengyu/v2/idioms-41-50.webp","index":9,"sliceWidth":420,"sliceHeight":344}}]